          "insert": "Operator Game Event Timeline"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-the-operator-trace-surfa-2": {
      "id": "b-index-the-operator-trace-surfa-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The operator trace surface presents server-authoritative accepted-event history by workflow correlation. It combines bounded event discovery, chronological reconstruction, safe cause navigation, and validated kernel trace links without inventing event or trace identity in the client."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-implementation-facing-20": {
      "id": "b-index-implementation-facing-20",
      "type": "callout",
      "props": {
        "title": "Implementation-facing contract",
        "tone": "note"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "This page specifies an implementation-facing contract (operator trace timeline UI) hosted under Harness State for now; a later pass may relocate it to the implementation tier."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-workflow-selection-and-d-3": {
      "id": "b-index-workflow-selection-and-d-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Workflow selection and display"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-selectable-workflow-kind-4": {
      "id": "b-index-selectable-workflow-kind-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Selectable workflow kinds are exactly "
        },
        {
          "insert": "run",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "sync",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "campaign",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "cycle",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". Workflow identity is derived from run, sync-workflow, PR-campaign, and cycle subjects plus recognized game-dispatch payloads. Events deduplicate by "
        },
        {
          "insert": "event_id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", group by correlation, and discard a correlation whose events imply conflicting workflow identities. Options show count and first and last sequence, sort by newest last sequence, honor a valid URL preference, and otherwise select the newest workflow."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-the-sole-workflow-filter-5": {
      "id": "b-index-the-sole-workflow-filter-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The sole workflow filter is correlation. The accepted-event list retains every recognized workflow correlation already loaded, while the selected correlation controls reconstruction. Accepted events display chronologically by ascending sequence with event type and identity, sequence, correlation, actor, subject, occurrence time, redacted payload summary, resolved cause, and zero, one, or many kernel links. An event cause links to its event; a command cause shows its command identity without an event link."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-selection-and-bounded-co-6": {
      "id": "b-index-selection-and-bounded-co-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Selection and bounded continuation"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-the-query-selector-is-c-7": {
      "id": "b-index-the-query-selector-is-c-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The query selector is "
        },
        {
          "insert": "correlation_id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". The canonical fragment is "
        },
        {
          "insert": "#game-event-${encodeURIComponent(eventId)}",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". Accepted event identities are 1 through 256 characters, begin with an alphanumeric character, and otherwise use only alphanumerics plus "
        },
        {
          "insert": ".",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "_",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "~",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": ":",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "-",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "; malformed, unsafe, or noncanonical encodings are rejected. Selecting a loaded event or event cause updates its exact correlation and event while preserving unrelated game, cycle, trace, and container URL identity."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-initial-discovery-and-re-8": {
      "id": "b-index-initial-discovery-and-re-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Initial discovery and reconstruction each load one bounded page. Limits are integers from 1 through 200, cursors are nonnegative safe integers, and a nonadvancing cursor, a cursor paired with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "has_more = false",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", or a mismatched reconstruction identity is rejected. Page merges deduplicate and restore ascending order. Continuation occurs only through explicit “Load next” controls; the client never chases an event through pages automatically."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-url-state-hydrates-at-in-9": {
      "id": "b-index-url-state-hydrates-at-in-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "URL state hydrates at initialization and on browser history or hash changes. Without a correlation, the newest workflow is selected and written to the URL. Correlation changes invalidate stale reconstruction. Once a selected event becomes available, its list item or reconstruction row receives focus once for that game, correlation, and event, then scrolls into the nearest visible position."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-trace-link-safety-10": {
      "id": "b-index-trace-link-safety-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Trace-link safety"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-the-persisted-server-hr-11": {
      "id": "b-index-the-persisted-server-hr-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The persisted server "
        },
        {
          "insert": "href",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " is the sole trace-identity source. The client may add missing matching game and cycle context plus the selected correlation and event fragment; it never invents missing trace or container identity or replaces server-supplied game or cycle identity."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-index-a-renderable-link-must-b-12": {
      "id": "b-index-a-renderable-link-must-b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A renderable link must be root-relative or same-origin and same-protocol HTTP(S), use exactly "
        },
        {
          "insert": "/workspace/trace",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", contain no credentials, scheme-relative form, backslash, line break, malformed percent escape, or decoded traversal, and pass validation again when clicked. Unsafe targets render as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Trace link unavailable",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
